<title>USA: Virginia Surry 1 nuclear unit at 77 percent.</title>
<headline>Virginia Surry 1 nuclear unit at 77 percent.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Virginia Power Co's 781 megawatt (MW) Surry 1 nuclear power unit restarted over the weekend and was operating at 77 percent power early this morning, Nuclear Regulatory Commission (NRC) said Monday.</p>
<p>The unit, in Gravel Neck, Va., was shut down Jan 24 due to a steam pipe leak.</p>
<p>The adjacent unit, with an identical generating capacity, is operating at full power.</p>
<p>Virginia Power is a subsidiary of Dominion Resources Inc.</p>
<p>((--New York Power Desk +212-859-1628))</p>
</text>
